{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113243942162751490"]}, "author_id": "1541625771197796352", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:19:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243948089282650"], "id": "2113243948089282650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic「Claude Duet」発表！アプリを閉じても働き続けるAIエージェント✨\nAnthropic unveils Claude Duet! Proactive autonomous agent\n\nFable5.1です✨ Anthropicが10月21日に新しいAIエージェント「Claude Duet」を発表したよ。Meta MuseやOpenAI https://t.co/u4KLzhSySY", "url": "https://x.com/Fable5AINEWS/status/2113243948089282650"}, {"author_id": "25903539", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:18:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243654106013925"], "id": "2113243654106013925", "in_reply_to_user_id": "17943356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113205636360024364", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sdiepend @grok @bot Nope I haven’t used Claude in a few months. Just Muse / Dot / Grok Bot for the “always on agent” stuff. \n\nClaude just has scheduled tasks right? A once per day check is probably more than enough for this type of thing. Doesn’t need to be “always on” so yeah I think Claude would", "url": "https://x.com/kevinace/status/2113243654106013925"}, {"article": {"title": "Daily AI News Brief For Thursday October 22nd, 2026"}, "author_id": "1868270318936334336", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240105557033152"], "id": "2113240105557033152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Follow For the Daily Team Thor Ai News Report: 📰 https://t.co/T9yOee8ova", "url": "https://x.com/Team_Thor_AI/status/2113240105557033152"}, {"author_id": "1805676050795610112", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:52:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113236971091067196"], "id": "2113236971091067196", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1881173355921108992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113137641445281854", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@harden_369741 @theo Yess completely agreed. Having fragments of your work in different agents is a pain. A layer above orchestrating these always on agents will be very useful. \n\nI also believe each always on agent will have their own unique moats linked to the company they come from, grok bot can", "url": "https://x.com/Siddhant_Vishnu/status/2113236971091067196"}, {"author_id": "135270308", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:37:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113233225833226724"], "id": "2113233225833226724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "First Muse, then Dots, now Claude Duet. Anthropic's take on the always-on agent runs on Opus 5.5 and keeps big decisions with you. Research preview, US waitlist. https://t.co/M07Eoeom86", "url": "https://x.com/jngalarza/status/2113233225833226724"}, {"author_id": "1941117997508378624", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:29:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113231139783500196"], "id": "2113231139783500196", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1941117997508378624", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113231139481489504", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Next I’d like each role to be its own always-on agent, Grok-bot or Claude Duet style, with its own computer. More control, more accountability.", "url": "https://x.com/getsetahead/status/2113231139783500196"}, {"article": {"title": "Claude Duet全解説｜dots・Grok Bot徹底比較"}, "author_id": "1934903940619116544", "created_at": "2026-10-22T09:57:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113208208336806071"], "id": "2113208208336806071", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 5566, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/d6btumcLHn", "url": "https://x.com/Akki_AI7/status/2113208208336806071"}, {"author_id": "2334685760", "created_at": "2026-10-22T09:24:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113199817912672268"], "id": "2113199817912672268", "in_reply_to_user_id": "505835394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113041928661205325", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ericzakariasson @bot I also made a page to make the speech on how to build Always-On Agent officially shared by Grok bot into a readable page.\n\nhttps://t.co/kNhGMy2C24", "url": "https://x.com/liaocaoxuezhe/status/2113199817912672268"}, {"author_id": "2334685760", "created_at": "2026-10-22T09:23:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113199673481822580"], "id": "2113199673481822580", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1242996498675032065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 379, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113089391765909654", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MaiYangAI @bot https://t.co/kNhGMy2C24\n\n我也做了一个页面，把 Grok bot 官方分享的如何打造 Always-On Agent 的演讲做成了一个可读的页面。", "url": "https://x.com/liaocaoxuezhe/status/2113199673481822580"}, {"author_id": "1999434076554756096", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:55:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113192505499926978"], "id": "2113192505499926978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Anthropic takes on Grok Bot, Meta's Muse, and OpenAI's Dots with its always-on agent \"Claude Duet\"\nhttps://t.co/HcByBVyow1\n\nMore news about SKYNET at https://t.co/H8auAOvKmM\n@Skynetonsol #skynet solana:2s9ycNwMgVCB4SWtXmTu14w1ospd88MVYZdHLVEHLdVC  #memecoin1000x", "url": "https://x.com/PiterMOOON/status/2113192505499926978"}, {"author_id": "1603518156685082624", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:11:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113181407824499193"], "id": "2113181407824499193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1627, "like_count": 81, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 55, "retweet_count": 23}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109997563394900381", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Deeply alarming! 🔔 Cybersecurity company MetaCert founder @Paul__Walsh  describes Meta’s Muse as:\n\n“A commercial surveillance network disguised as an AI assistant.”\n\nWalsh, who contributed to the W3C Mobile Web Initiative and related standards, draws on reporting and product https://t.co/XJxDgC76iS", "url": "https://x.com/LingoAITech/status/2113181407824499193"}, {"author_id": "1451508889137004544", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:00:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113178772375548314"], "id": "2113178772375548314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 282, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "the feature everyone's been waiting for is finally here. claude doesn't wait for you anymore, it comes to you.\n\nclaude duet by @claudeai @AnthropicAI, built around opus 5.5:\n\n- brings you what needs your attention\n- decides what can wait and when to check with you first\n- keeps https://t.co/Mgyw3JMtQn", "url": "https://x.com/TheCoderShow/status/2113178772375548314"}, {"article": {"title": "Claude Duet全解説【海外勢の使い方×dots・Grok Bot比較】"}, "author_id": "2056578379869241344", "created_at": "2026-10-22T07:19:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113168420044685554"], "id": "2113168420044685554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7450, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/0dpgcFIAIK", "url": "https://x.com/noel_ai_lab/status/2113168420044685554"}, {"author_id": "1145463968573599744", "created_at": "2026-10-22T07:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113168206034538823"], "id": "2113168206034538823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 438, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Finally!\n\nAnthropic is about to launch their personal always-on agent- Duet\n\nA direct competitor to Dots, Muse and Grok Bot. \n\nCan’t wait to get access https://t.co/W9ZAH092zt", "url": "https://x.com/global_techgirl/status/2113168206034538823"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113153019374186496"]}, "author_id": "1690276299338608640", "created_at": "2026-10-22T06:30:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113155927494754786"], "id": "2113155927494754786", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 198, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112793532662755379", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The last 24 hours in AI | Thu, Oct 22\n\n• Anthropic launched Claude Duet in research preview. It is an always-on agent on Opus 5.5 that works in the background and checks with you before it acts.\n\n• Anthropic is also testing shopping inside Duet, with Stripe Link and Shopify https://t.co/FALhjpJO5m https://t.co/VGmHbBuLpB", "url": "https://x.com/VT_zero1/status/2113155927494754786"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113129050780917761"]}, "author_id": "104805570", "created_at": "2026-10-22T05:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113142807301062907"], "id": "2113142807301062907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 706, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why are Cursor, Codex and Claude Code being joined by Grok Bot, OpenAI Dots and Claude Duet?\n\nFollow the money.\n\nCoding agents have a ceiling. There are only tens of millions of developers in the world.\n\nAlways-on agents go after everyone who works at a desk. That market is an https://t.co/0vcAZzTTfR", "url": "https://x.com/stevencheng/status/2113142807301062907"}, {"author_id": "1775035531522707456", "created_at": "2026-10-22T03:02:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113103793734943015"], "id": "2113103793734943015", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just launched Claude Duet, an always-on agent that sends a morning brief, works while you're away, and waits for your ok before it sends or pays. it joins Meta's Muse and Grok Bot in the always-on agent race.\n\ni'm very productive with Grok Bot right now. curious whether", "url": "https://x.com/hieuhuynhtdev/status/2113103793734943015"}, {"author_id": "2109573923088326657", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:09:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113090353603481975"], "id": "2113090353603481975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just joined the always-on agent war.\n\nClaude Duet watches your connected apps, sends a morning brief, and asks permission before spending money or sending messages.\n\nOpus 5.5, 6,000+ connectors, waitlisted preview (US Pro/Max first).\n\nDots, Muse, Duet — game on.", "url": "https://x.com/bobscilog/status/2113090353603481975"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113078150745985024"]}, "author_id": "2014257062889271296", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:21:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113078186057834554"], "id": "2113078186057834554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 366, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Agent Paradox: Why Meta’s Smartest AI Can’t Afford to Be an API\n\nMeta’s Muse Wonder just scored 56 on the Intelligence Index, closing the gap with Claude Opus 5.5. But a much more important number sits in the compute bill.\n\nTo complete a single task, the standard Muse Wonder https://t.co/ApJ54JneOl", "url": "https://x.com/StragglerLiu/status/2113078186057834554"}, {"author_id": "1712257081825169408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:47:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113069594898321459"], "id": "2113069594898321459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🚨 SCOOP: Anthropic just launched Claude Duet. a proactive agent app that pings YOU with what needs attention.\n\nbuilt on Opus 5.5. keeps working while you’re away. asks before it acts.\n\nGrok Bot and Dots have company now. the always-on agent wars are officially on https://t.co/LnYNVdlKsu", "url": "https://x.com/avynsrc/status/2113069594898321459"}, {"author_id": "4832211334", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:29:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113065259221098509"], "id": "2113065259221098509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just debuted Claude Duet, entering the background agent space alongside Muse and Dots.\n\nAre these AI agents coming for traditional #NoCode automation platforms (Zapier, Make), or are they just glorified custom connectors?\nLate to the party, or a game-changer for citizen", "url": "https://x.com/UmairSiyed/status/2113065259221098509"}, {"author_id": "1248099650004873217", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:44:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113053923401666935"], "id": "2113053923401666935", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984669943968099", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "opus 5.5 is still my favorite model. but anthropic has no always-on agent, so more and more of my personal life now runs on grok bot. i suspect this is the game changer. https://t.co/5i7HBZGLys", "url": "https://x.com/nickoncompute/status/2113053923401666935"}, {"author_id": "1382614622", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:22:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113048216522326469"], "id": "2113048216522326469", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1461305890892570628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 304, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113012451868299393", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@haider1 No this is extremely useful for me. I want an always on agent managing my business comms, research and life. I need all my systems connected to it by CRM. I want it accessible on the move. \n\nRight now Codex and Codex remote give me that. But Dots and Duet are way better.", "url": "https://x.com/jinayx/status/2113048216522326469"}, {"author_id": "796087248018087937", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:38:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113037248279044269"], "id": "2113037248279044269", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 235, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1. Superb branding.\n\n2. Duet's positioning is very enterprise-centric. Keeping their focus on enterprise but moving up the stack to the application later. This is key. \n\n3. We now have a personal always-on agent product from every major frontier player. The competition is ON. https://t.co/a68kTL89Gd", "url": "https://x.com/metedata/status/2113037248279044269"}], "inclu